{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/animated_title_small.gif?t=1746959338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/welcome_eng.png?t=1746959338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BLOW-UP is a single-player first person movement shooter campaign inspired by the best shooters around the Y2K era, reimagining classic action with frantic and dynamic gameplay, along with a modern take on retro graphics and a visually striking \u201ccolorful gore\u201d aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/gif_steam_store_frame_2.gif?t=1746959338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/gameplay.png?t=1746959338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your objective is to beat the 20 stages the game has to offer as fast as possible, each one will introduce new tools that will aid your quest of vengeance, but also new challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/narrative_eng.png?t=1746959338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put yourself in the circuit board of the M098 Barbara, a 3 meter tall industrial robot rewired by Ann, the last human alive, to avenge humanity from the alien race that has destroyed Earth. Use any means necessary to violently deny the military occupation the aliens have established on Earth\u2019s debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/bloodbath_eng.png?t=1746959338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 weapons, each one with an alternate fire mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brutal melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement mechanics that are also lethal for enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 stage replayable campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite wave mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/extras/BL0WUP_DemoFinal.gif?t=1746959338\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2301940?t=1746959338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/350d9c98c40f3fcea2d4ec4480f6a6ec5cf8aae5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746959338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/d0b50ee81d24fc7102dda2edb6a48d6144ca3cf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746959338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301940/d0b50ee81d24fc7102dda2edb6a48d6144ca3cf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746959338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Use of fictional weapons, violence and stylized gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2429670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">